1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
The train leaves in ten minutes.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,500
Don't run. The platform is still open.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,200
I saved you a seat by the window.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,900
If we miss this one, the next is at midnight.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Come on. I'll hold the door.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,500
Look, the signal is green.
We can still make it.
